body:
## Overview
Quests and challenge system with time-bound objectives. Users complete quests to earn large XP rewards and exclusive badges. Quests refresh daily/weekly.

## Endpoints
| Method | Path | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| GET    | `/quests` | List active quests + my progress |
| GET    | `/quests/:id` | Quest details |
| POST   | `/quests/:id/claim` | Claim completed quest reward |

## Data Models
```typescript
@Entity()
class Quest {
  @PrimaryGeneratedColumn('uuid') id: string;
  @Column() title: string;
  @Column() description: string;
  @Column() type: 'daily' | 'weekly' | 'one_time';
  @Column({ type: 'jsonb' }) objectives: QuestObjective[];
  @Column() xpReward: number;
  @Column({ nullable: true }) badgeReward: string;
  @Column() expiresAt: Date;
}

interface QuestObjective {
  action: string;    // 'send_messages', 'tip_users', etc.
  target: number;
  current?: number;  // filled at query time
}

@Entity()
class UserQuestProgress {
  @ManyToOne(() => User) user: User;
  @ManyToOne(() => Quest) quest: Quest;
  @Column({ type: 'jsonb' }) progress: Record<string, number>;
  @Column({ default: false }) isCompleted: boolean;
  @Column({ default: false }) isClaimed: boolean;
}
```

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Daily quests refresh at 00:00 UTC
- [ ] Quest progress updated asynchronously via event emitter
- [ ] Completed but unclaimed quests available for 24 hours
- [ ] One-time quests never repeat for the same user
